# Headless Test Platform (HTP)

Vision and architecture: [docs/HTP.md](../../docs/HTP.md).  
**Agent workflow (mandatory):** [docs/HTP Playbook for AI Agents.md](../../docs/HTP%20Playbook%20for%20AI%20Agents.md) — gather once (sit still, throw switch, dump **local graph**), Core walks it in `dotnet test`, cab only after HTP green.  
Product checkboxes: [PM_PLAN.md](../../PM_PLAN.md).

**HTP north star:** the panacea job loop is **true in `dotnet test`** before cab chrome. Grow the harness **on the current product lock** (**9.1** Physics ticks; CP0 Topology is green). Do not cab-debug a lock while its Core walk is red.

## Required

- **Follow the playbook.** Gather-once **graph** dump → fold fixture → named HTP **routing** walk green → only then pin smoke. Do not ask the player to cab-prove Core math. Do not full-map cache.
- **Inline, not an epic.** Topology / Physics / State Machine ship inside **8.7** / **9.1** / **13.x**. No HTP-as-epic. **`2.14.x` is Epic 14 Maps desk**, not HTP. No second repo, no `htp-architect` skill.
- **This lock only.** Do not replay closed **7.x** (`2.7.2` thermal ≠ Maps **`2.8.7.31`**). Current lock is **9.1.3** Core pathfinder (9.1.2 Evaluate math is green; do not cab-debug `TrackPathAhead`).
- **Seed dump is gather, not debug.** One-off `graph.txt` / `corridor.txt` per yard/dest. Player gathers; agent folds; CI replays. Never per-frame.
- **Stop and ask.** Core green on this slice → deploy → **pin-sized** cab smoke only ([deploy-before-smoke.mdc](deploy-before-smoke.mdc)). Waiting on smoke is a pause ([one-story-one-ship.mdc](one-story-one-ship.mdc)).
- **Tandem.** Gemini reviews and names gaps; Cursor lands Core, fixtures, deploy. Same north star. Disagreement → ask the human.

## Forbidden

- “Test everything” / leap to GO or a full job in the same breath as **9.1**.
- Cab-walking CLEARED to discover polarity the walk already owns.
- Treating a hand-built SW sketch as live-yard routing goldens after a dump exists (fold it).
- Treating Player.log as the regression suite ([smoke-gates-tier1-ci.mdc](smoke-gates-tier1-ci.mdc)).
